---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Responsibility — AASRA" description="How AASRA works: materials, makers, fair pricing, and honest service.">
  <!-- Editorial hero -->
  <section class="hero" style="height:min(56vh,500px); min-height:380px;">
    <img src="/images/campaign/story-artisan.webp" alt="Hands weaving on a wooden loom" class="hero-image" loading="eager" width="2000" height="1125" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="kicker">Responsibility</div>
      <h1>How we work</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px; text-align:center;">
      <p style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.95;">
        A store is a set of choices. We choose slow production over volume, natural materials
        over synthetics, fair prices over theatre, and clarity over fine print. Here is exactly
        what that means.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight reveal">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-no">01</div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Made by hand, paid fairly</h3>
          <p>Our dhurries are woven on handlooms by weaving families in Punjab; our linen is sewn in small workshops; our ceramics thrown in studio batches. We buy at prices the makers set, not the lowest we could negotiate — and the price you pay reflects that honestly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-no">02</div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Materials that return to the earth</h3>
          <p>Pure cotton, pure linen, solid teak, mineral glazes. No polyester blends, no plastic laminates. Packaging is paper, board, and cotton twine — protective, minimal, and compostable at home.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-no">03</div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Small batches, no dead stock</h3>
          <p>We produce in runs small enough to sell through. Nothing is shredded or burned at season's end; pieces that do not sell are reduced quietly and sold, or donated to families resettling in Karachi.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-no">04</div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Built to be repaired</h3>
          <p>Every piece is constructed to be used hard and repaired locally — proper hems, reinforced weaves, no planned obsolescence. Care notes ship with every order, and our team will talk you through a repair on Email.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-no">05</div>
        <div class="service-body">
          <h3>Clear terms, no traps</h3>
          <p>Prices in PKR, taxes shown plainly, returns honoured within 7 days. Our policies are written to be read. If a term is ever unclear, ask us and we will answer in plain words.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--surface); border-top:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="kicker">Questions about how we work</div>
      <h2 style="margin-bottom:1.4rem;">Ask us anything</h2>
      <div class="service-links" style="justify-content:center;">
        <a href="/contact">Write to us</a>
        <a href="mailto:orders@aasra.shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
